<p>Vomit on the ground around you, healing any undead in the area and damaging anyone else.</p><p>Lasts 10 turns and deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Constitution 100">32, 39, 44, 48, 52</acronym> blight damage or heals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Constitution 100">48, 58, 66, 72, 78</acronym> life.</p><p>Creatures standing in the retch also have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 17%, 22%, 27%, 31%</acronym> chance to remove a physical effect each turn; undeads will be stripped from a detrimental effect while others will be stripped from a beneficial effect.</p><p>When you stand in your own retch your racial -20% global speed is cancelled.</p>